      "mergeID": "655b82a9f0009c67645cc171",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The client will crash very often when trying to use the Quick Menu or Main Menu, seems to happen a lot when trying to load a thumbnail.\n\nKnown methods to reproduce:\n\n- Open the QM, click on a friend's current world, crash. \n\n- Open MM, go to worlds tab, switch to trending, scroll down, crash.\n\n- Double click here tab in QM to go to world info, crash.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1381] Frequent crashes when using the menu",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "655429910f5de1fd00e56149",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been getting this too. It's kind of reproducible, sometimes I can get it to happen 5+ times in a row, then it will start working fine.\n\nThe world or instance for which you're opening instance info does not seem to matter, nor does the world you are currently in, nor your home world or any worlds you had been in previously during that session. I've been able to replicate this on a fresh launch with the default VRC home world.\n\nHere is a video and corresponding log:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uz9Kc3x-a3Y\n\nhttps://pastebin.com/c24G4TAr\n\nBuild 1381",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
